# Jordan's job search

Looking for work is a job in itself, so I have given it a routine: one strong application every weekday morning, reaching out to someone on Tuesdays and Thursdays, and a review of the numbers every Friday afternoon. Each of these appears in my tasks on the right day.

JobSearch: Project manager in renewable energy|Project Manager|65000|2026-10-05|2027-01-31|15000|3200
    Routine:
    * Send one strong application|Search the job boards and send one application that really fits
        Schedule: Applications|Weekly||2026-10-05
