    * Reach out to someone|One message or call to someone in my network or an agent
        Schedule: Networking|Weekly||2026-10-06
            On: Tue, Thu
            DueTime: 2:00 pm
    * Review the week|Look at the numbers: applications sent, responses and interviews. If the responses are low, change the CV.
